lutionSelector", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [270, 126], "pos": [0, 1296], "id": 16, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ResolutionSelector"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [5], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["{\"summary\":{\"meta\":[\"anime illustration\",\"ensemble scene\",\"Azur Lane fan art\"],\"canvas\":\"single\",\"caption\":\"A lively Azur Lane group illustration of exactly six distinct shipgirls at an afternoon tea gathering in a sunlit naval port conservatory: Akagi, Illustrious, Kaga, Belfast, Enterprise, and Prinz Eugen, one of each. A single continuous scene viewed from a slightly elevated camera, with expressive faces, crisp delicate anime linework, clean cel shading and luminous pastel highlights. Three standing figures occupy the rear: Akagi at the upper left, Illustrious at the upper center, and Kaga at the upper right. Three closer figures occupy the foreground: Belfast at the lower left, Enterprise at the lower center, and Prinz Eugen at the lower right. Their heads form two staggered levels; all six faces are fully visible and separated. The foreground figures naturally obscure parts of the rear figures' lower bodies. White window frames, a glimpse of blue harbor water, soft greenery and small tea tables connect the space. Warm sunlight enters from the upper left, catching hair and clothing. The atmosphere is cheerful and candid, with varied hand gestures and eye directions. Character-specific default outfits and accessories remain distinct. No naval combat rigging, weapons, extra people, background silhouettes, mirrors, lettering, labels, logos, panel divisions or decorative borders.\"},\"items\":[{\"label\":\"character\",\"caption\":\"Akagi (Azur Lane), at the rear left, with her face near the upper-left area and her shoulders behind Belfast. Long dark brown hair, brown fox ears, red eyes, and a fan of fluffy brown fox tails behind her own body. Her recognizable red-and-white Japanese kimono-inspired default outfit has broad sleeves and a dark waist sash. She gives the viewer a playful, confident smile and holds an open red folding fan beside her shoulder, away from her face. Her red sleeve and brown tails remain on the left side of the gathering.\",\"bbox\":[-408,-736,158,-258]},{\"label\":\"character\",\"caption\":\"Illustrious (Azur Lane), standing at the rear center, her face high above Enterprise's head. Long flowing silver-white hair, blue eyes, her recognizable white wide-brimmed hat with blue ribbon accents, and an elegant white-and-blue default dress with delicate frills. She smiles warmly and holds a small white porcelain teacup at chest height. Her hat, eyes and teacup are clearly visible. Her white hat and blue-trimmed dress stay with her; she has human ears and no fox tails.\",\"bbox\":[-416,-248,128,248]},{\"label\":\"character\",\"caption\":\"Kaga (Azur Lane), standing at the rear right behind Prinz Eugen. Short white hair, white fox ears, blue eyes, and a spread of fluffy white fox tails behind her own body. Her recognizable blue-and-white Japanese kimono-inspired default outfit has broad sleeves and a dark sash. She has a composed expression with a faint smile, looking inward toward the gathering, and gently holds a small blue-and-white tea bowl in both hands below her face. Her blue sleeves and white tails occupy the right rear of the scene, separate from Akagi's red sleeves and brown tails.\",\"bbox\":[-408,272,158,736]},{\"label\":\"character\",\"caption\":\"Belfast (Azur Lane), close to the camera at the foreground left, visible from head to upper thighs, with her face around the middle-left of the image below Akagi's face. Long silver hair, blue eyes, a white frilled maid headband, and her recognizable black-and-white Royal Navy maid uniform with a white apron, dark fitted bodice and white gloves. She leans slightly toward the center with a gentle smile, holding a small silver serving tray with two teacups in both hands at waist height. The tray remains below all faces. Her headband is a maid headdress rather than a broad-brimmed hat.\",\"bbox\":[-92,-704,432,-194]},{\"label\":\"character\",\"caption\":\"Enterprise (Azur Lane), the prominent foreground-center figure, visible from head to upper thighs, with her face around the center of the image below Illustrious. Long straight silver-white hair, violet eyes, and her recognizable white naval officer cap with a dark band. Her default outfit combines a white military top, black necktie, dark skirt and a dark officer coat draped over her shoulders. She looks directly toward the viewer with a restrained friendly smile, raising one gloved hand in a small greeting beside her own shoulder. Her cap, necktie and violet eyes are clearly readable; she has human ears and no fox tails.\",\"bbox\":[-132,-228,432,272]},{\"label\":\"character\",\"caption\":\"Prinz Eugen (Azur Lane), close to the camera at the foreground right, visible from head to upper thighs, with her face around the middle-right of the image below Kaga. Long silver hair with a distinctive red streak, red eyes, black-and-red mechanical hair ornaments, and her recognizable dark Iron Blood military-inspired default outfit with red accents and black gloves. She angles her shoulders toward Enterprise, wears an amused confident smile, and raises a clear glass of amber iced tea beside her own shoulder. Her red hair streak and red eyes remain distinct from Enterprise's violet eyes and Belfast's blue eyes. She has no fox ears or tails.\",\"bbox\":[-92,242,432,744]}],\"bbox_coord_space\":\"abs_centralized\",\"bbox_format\":\"yxyx\"}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 3, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", 